 "description": "Secure Mobile Cryptographic Module provides core cryptographic functionality in a Windows Embedded Handheld environment. It supports XTS-AES-128 cipher mode for storage encryption, KDF acc. to NIST SP 800-108 to derive the storage encryption key, and HMAC-SHA-256 for integrity protection of its binaries and settings. For generation of XTS tweak values a validated RNG (Cert. #286) contained in \"Windows CE and Windows Mobile Enhanced Cryptographic Provider (RSAENH)\" , which is a FIPS 140-2 certified cryptographic software module contained in the platform.",
